      "text": "#HYDTPinfo\n🚦 TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚦\nIn connection with Eid-ul-Fitr (Ramzan) on 21-03-2026 (7:00 AM to 11:30 AM), heavy public gatherings are expected at:\n📍 Mir Alam Tank (near Zoo Park)\n📍 Hockey Ground, Masab Tank\n⚠️ Expect traffic congestion at:\nBahadurpura, Kalapather, Nawab Saheb Kunta, Shastripuram, Danamma Huts, Masab Tank, Khaja Mansion, NMDC & 1/12 Junction\n👮‍♂️ Commuters are advised to plan travel in advance and use alternate routes.\n#HyderabadTraffic #TrafficAdvisory #EidUlFitr #Ramzan #CommuterAlert",
